<title>SPAIN: BBV 9-month attrib profit 70.45 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>BBV 9-month attrib profit 70.45 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first nine months in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit		     129.050	vs     107.479</p>
<p> Net taxed			    86.342	vs	71.949</p>
<p> Attributable profit		70.455	vs	55.691</p>
<p> Operating margin		  171.489	vs     116.170</p>
<p> Ordinary margin		   434.266	vs     347.017</p>
